# Docker build context exclusions. CAUTION: runner/ and examples/ MUST stay in
# the context — the Dockerfile COPYs them as the /runner.zip installer payload
# (the v1.1 version of this file excluded them, which broke the image build
# once the Dockerfile gained those COPYs; found during deploy pre-flight).
# data/ can contain client documents and the blinding escrow — never in a build.
.git
.gitignore
data/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
tests/
docs/
scripts/
README.md
*.zip
*.bundle
